WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.793
A mistake? "Match" → "Corrections".

2
00:00:04.843 --> 00:00:07.598
Each correction is saved when you confirm it. The referee sees it in the log.

3
00:00:07.648 --> 00:00:10.138
"Last point went to the wrong team": the point moves to the other team.

4
00:00:10.188 --> 00:00:15.567
Check before and after, then "Confirm".

5
00:00:15.617 --> 00:00:22.617
A rally was not entered: "Add a missed point".

6
00:00:24.786 --> 00:00:29.064
Line-ups, time-outs, substitutions, sanctions and remarks can be fixed here too.

7
00:00:29.114 --> 00:00:33.819
"All sets": a finished set has "Correct final score", "Set times" and "Reopen set".

8
00:00:33.869 --> 00:00:39.488
A set closed too early? "Reopen set". The sets after it are deleted.

9
00:00:39.538 --> 00:00:42.109
Set 1 is open again at 25:20: "Decision change" fixes its last point.

10
00:00:42.159 --> 00:00:44.543
Or "Confirm" ends it again.
